      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOUNDS OF PEACE (6) shared the pace and fought on gamely for second by a head as the favourite on debut here 2 weeks ago, and though she has a tougher gate this time, she can go one better. SH'BOURNE HIFLYER (5) rattled home late for second by less than a length here over 1200m 2 weeks ago, and an extra 220m is the ideal next step third up. Stick with her on an each-way basis. AWESOME ORPHAN (2) has been trying to win a race for some time, and was not bad when finishing fifth off a wide trip here last week. She gets a nice swing in her draw here, and with Darmanin sticking, she can figure in the top 3. RAMIRO (10) ended his 2-start juvenile prep in stakes grade, and resumes with 3 trials under his belt. He will be ready to rumble fresh up off a decent draw. ",
